[120.623143, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[3msales_data.csv\u001b[22m \u2013 Sample dataset\u001b[23m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 5 columns: Product (non-numeric), Units_Sold, Price, Revenue, and Discount_Percent\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2022 20 rows of realistic e-commerce data with various product categories (Widgets, Gadgets, Tools,\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KPremium items)\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mResults\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KRunning python3 csvstats.py sales_data.csv produced this table:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K     Column      | Count |    Min     |    Max     |    Mean    |   Median   |  Std Dev\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K   Units_Sold    |  20   |   54.00    |   312.00   |   147.45   |   139.50   |   70.66\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K     Price       |  20   |   12.75    |   145.00   |   49.77    |   35.50    |   37.71\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K    Revenue      |  20   |  3000.00   |  11020.00  |  5535.72   |  5305.72   |  2141.11\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KDiscount_Percent |  20   |    0.00    |   35.00    |   12.25    |   10.00    |    9.59\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KThe tool correctly:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K- Identified all 4 numeric columns (skipped the non-numeric \"Product\" column)\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K- Counted all 20 data rows\r\r\n\u001b[2G\u001b[K Computed accurate\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25